              </div>
      
            
    
    <div id="bootstrap-panel--6--content" class="panel-body panel-collapse collapse fade">
            
<div  class="paragraph paragraph--type--bp-two-columns paragraph--style--66-33">
    
<div  class="paragraph__column">
    
<div  class="bp_two_col_left col-md-8">
          <div  class="top20">
        
            <div class="views-element-container form-group"><div class="view view-w4-cdsi-to-node view-id-w4_cdsi_to_node view-display-id-block_2 js-view-dom-id-065196261850eebf79d58a48922a94c3dec1a33b6a096bfe9514d4b9cd67ac9b">
  
    
      
      <div class="view-content">
          <div class="views-row"><div class="views-field views-field-bando-scadenze"><div class="field-content"><h3>Bando di ammissione</h3>
<p>Consulta il bando per scoprire le <strong>date</strong> e i <strong>contenuti</strong> del test e <strong>tutte le informazioni</strong> su come iscriverti.</p>
<p><strong>Domanda di ammissione:</strong> fai riferimento al bando</p>
<p><strong><a href="https://apps.unimi.it/files/bandi/bando-2027-1-medicina-e-chirurgia---international-medical-school-%28classe-lm-41-r%29.pdf?31-AUG-26">Leggi il Bando</a></strong></p>
<p><br><strong>Note</strong></p>
<p>Data test di ammissione: 29 settembre 2026</p></div></div></div>

    </div>
  
